{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01709","headline":"杂曲歌辞 长安少年行十首 六 · 李廓","name":"杂曲歌辞 长安少年行十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赏春惟逐胜，大宅可曾归。\n不乐还逃席，多狂惯衩衣。\n歌人踏月起，语燕卷帘飞。\n好妇惟相妒，倡楼不醉稀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李廓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01709.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01709","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}